1
00:00:00,060 --> 00:00:01,844
Why do we need

2
00:00:01,844 --> 00:00:02,800
Cerebras when we already

3
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:04,720
have the NVIDIA GPUs?

4
00:00:04,720 --> 00:00:05,970
So, first there's two

5
00:00:05,970 --> 00:00:07,360
parts of an AI workload.

6
00:00:07,360 --> 00:00:08,180
First is training

7
00:00:08,180 --> 00:00:08,620
the model.

8
00:00:08,640 --> 00:00:09,250
That's the act

9
00:00:09,250 --> 00:00:10,020
of actually teaching

10
00:00:10,020 --> 00:00:10,780
the model, making

11
00:00:10,780 --> 00:00:11,400
it intelligent.

12
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:12,260
The second part

13
00:00:12,260 --> 00:00:13,050
is inference,

14
00:00:13,050 --> 00:00:13,660
which is the act

15
00:00:13,660 --> 00:00:14,380
of actually using

16
00:00:14,380 --> 00:00:15,000
the model.

17
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:16,380
So that's when we send

18
00:00:16,380 --> 00:00:17,760
a request to ChatGPT

19
00:00:17,760 --> 00:00:18,500
and we get a response

20
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:18,820
back.

21
00:00:18,840 --> 00:00:19,770
So with inference,

22
00:00:19,770 --> 00:00:20,350
there's a lot

23
00:00:20,350 --> 00:00:21,120
of different points

24
00:00:21,120 --> 00:00:22,160
that you can optimize

25
00:00:22,160 --> 00:00:22,500
for.

26
00:00:22,520 --> 00:00:24,030
NVIDIA GPUs were

27
00:00:24,030 --> 00:00:25,960
designed to be very good

28
00:00:25,960 --> 00:00:27,680
at running high batches

29
00:00:27,680 --> 00:00:28,810
where they can run a lot

30
00:00:28,810 --> 00:00:29,840
of parallel compute.

31
00:00:29,900 --> 00:00:31,470
However, the high batch

32
00:00:31,470 --> 00:00:32,550
comes at the cost

33
00:00:32,550 --> 00:00:34,040
of interactivity.

34
00:00:34,040 --> 00:00:35,048
Within inference, there

35
00:00:35,048 --> 00:00:35,720
are workloads

36
00:00:35,720 --> 00:00:36,400
where you need a lot

37
00:00:36,400 --> 00:00:37,340
of real-time user

38
00:00:37,340 --> 00:00:38,320
interactivity.

39
00:00:38,320 --> 00:00:39,600
So, for example, think

40
00:00:39,600 --> 00:00:40,570
of if you're trying

41
00:00:40,570 --> 00:00:40,920
to code

42
00:00:40,940 --> 00:00:41,840
with an AI agent.

43
00:00:41,840 --> 00:00:42,740
You want your request

44
00:00:42,740 --> 00:00:43,690
to come back as quickly

45
00:00:43,690 --> 00:00:44,400
as possible.

